  "npc_response": "A phoenix feather? Out of thin air? I've been around this ring long enough to know that nothing comes from thin air — not on this station, not in this reactor. If you want something made, it has to be made with tools, materials, and someone willing to sweat. And right now, the only thing that's failing is the shielding. What are you actually after?"
}

{
